# strip_comments feature rules
# Scopes the source behind the per-job `strip_comments` frontmatter setting:
# the Job field + default-true accessor, the oneshot executor call site that
# forwards it to the cx Manager, and (cross-repo) the cx comment-stripper the
# generated context flows through. Changes to any of these should trigger the
# oneshot-strip-comments E2E scenario, which runs real oneshot jobs with the
# setting defaulted (strip) and set false (keep) and asserts the generated
# context accordingly.
# Paths are relative to the flow repo root.

pkg/orchestration/job.go
pkg/orchestration/oneshot_executor.go
../cx/pkg/context/strip.go
../cx/pkg/context/generate.go
../cx/pkg/context/manager.go
tests/e2e/tend/scenarios/oneshot_strip_comments.go
